Package: sparrow-hawk-ai-sdk-support
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, libopencv-imgcodecs-dev, libopencv-videoio-dev, rpm2cpio, cpio
Description: Helper scripts for HostPC-built AI SDK applications (HyCo/Reaction)
 Sparrow Hawk Debian ships a newer OpenCV than the one HostPC-built AI
 SDK applications (e.g. HyCo/Reaction) are typically linked against,
 and some of those applications only run correctly as root.
 .
 This package pulls in OpenCV so it is available on the system, and
 installs ai-sdk-support-helper, an operator-invoked helper script
 to create shared library ABI compatibility symlinks (e.g. for OpenCV
 or libcrypt), to unlock/configure the root account (including
 enabling password-based root SSH login), and to check for the uio
 devices those apps require. None of these actions are performed
 automatically.
